---
description: Working agreements for the Nimbus Ferry service
alwaysApply: true
---

Nimbus Ferry is a FastAPI service that books ferry tickets. Python 3.12, uv, Alembic.

Use `uv add` instead of `pip install` when you need a new package.
New dependencies need approval first.
Every new Python file starts with `# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0`.
Use Conventional Commits for commit messages.
Applied Alembic revisions in `alembic/versions/` must not be edited.
Prefer clear names over explanatory comments.
